      "message": "Even for the latest API level, if the BOARD_VNDK_VERSION is 30 or older, LLNDK must generate the vendor variants for that version.\nTo avoid using Atoi, I have uploaded PS1 that uses the variable from the makefile. It requires a new build variable on Make. The version check must be done in Make in this case. But I uploaded PS2 because the new build variable is not required for the manual setting.\nThis must not be too expensive. When I tested with the unittest code, the build time slightly reduced with this patch for the specific case (BOARD_VNDK_VERSION\u003d30). I think skipping additional variant creation must improve the build time.",
